#### catch_rust_turns_a_panic_into_an_error (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> rust\n\n:= ~ok = 7i32\n:= ~message = \"boom\"\n:= fine = new_future_move (\\ () => ok) |> async_of_future |> catch_rust |> run_synchronously\n:= failed =\n    new_future_move (\\ () => failwith message : i32) |> async_of_future |> catch_rust |> run_synchronously\n(async_outcome fine, async_outcome failed) |> _assert_eq (\"7\", \"error\")","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> rust

  := ~ok = 7i32
  := ~message = "boom"
  := fine = new_future_move (\ () => ok) |> async_of_future |> catch_rust |> run_synchronously
  := failed =
      new_future_move (\ () => failwith message : i32) |> async_of_future |> catch_rust |> run_synchronously
  (async_outcome fine, async_outcome failed) |> _assert_eq ("7", "error")
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```
